THIRD-PARTY IMAGERY -- NOT COVERED BY THE APACHE LICENSE

data/micro/ (310 JPEG frames) and data/contact_sheet.jpg are derived from the HPWREN
Fire Ignition images Library (FIgLib), HPWREN, University of California San Diego:
http://hpwren.ucsd.edu/ -- https://hpwren.ucsd.edu/FIgLib/

FIgLib carries no SPDX licence; its terms ask for a credit reference, given above and in
data/micro/PROVENANCE.md. These frames are downscaled excerpts kept in the repository only
so that `make verify` can recompute real numbers offline. They are used for evaluation
only, never for training, and they remain subject to HPWREN's terms, not to the Apache
License. The full evaluation corpus is fetched from HPWREN by `make fetch` and is never
committed.

The live wall replays HPWREN frames fetched onto the server under the same terms; the
credit line is shown in the UI and carried in the stream's metadata.

